/Generate-MD-Files/

# NOTE: .claude/agents/ is intentionally NOT gitignored -- gitignoring it
# previously made Claude Code's agent picker stop discovering the custom
# subagents defined there (the discovery scanner is gitignore-aware and
# skips ignored paths). It stays untracked and must never be `git add`ed;
# rely on always staging files by explicit name, never -A/., to keep it
# out of commits without breaking agent discovery.
